                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0520d38b-3a64-3963-804c-49ce572ca836",
                        "entry_id": "14195b61-026f-3d53-8cb2-59b54817f102",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Rendu idiot, stupide."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "44f87f1f-a73c-4c0f-8675-8ee22c2c4101",
                                "sense_id": "0520d38b-3a64-3963-804c-49ce572ca836",
                                "text": "Dans The Interview, James Franco et Seth Rogen, amis depuis qu’ils se sont rencontrés en école de journalisme, sont respectivement un présentateur décérébré et célébrissime de télévision poubelle, et son producteur, qui traverse une crise de conscience (pourquoi est-il tombé si bas alors qu’il avait les moyens de devenir un bon journaliste ?)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2525f6f0-c5d3-4585-abf0-99de6418f0af",
                        "source_entry_id": "14195b61-026f-3d53-8cb2-59b54817f102",
                        "source_sense_id": "0520d38b-3a64-3963-804c-49ce572ca836",
                        "target_lang_word": "mindless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mindless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd9b1b3e-010b-311b-8fa7-1ac5fc3e1c8b",
                                        "entry_id": "220c854d-1be9-3af8-b0e8-a5751190f5c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Showing a lack of forethought or sense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "252782d9-f53b-3a2a-9972-bdb0f8b030d2",
                                        "entry_id": "220c854d-1be9-3af8-b0e8-a5751190f5c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having no sensible meaning or purpose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b9c8808-56d2-44ca-b9cc-70ab63bc5c5d",
                                                "sense_id": "252782d9-f53b-3a2a-9972-bdb0f8b030d2",
                                                "text": "An act of mindless violence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "570f106b-d804-4190-a684-10cd2e6c0f3a",
                                                "sense_id": "252782d9-f53b-3a2a-9972-bdb0f8b030d2",
                                                "text": "“I Love Lisa” opens with one of my favorite underappreciated running jokes from The Simpsons: the passive-aggressive, quietly contentious relationship of radio jocks Bill and Marty, whose mindless happy talk regularly gives way to charged exchanges that betray the simmering resentment and disappointment perpetually lingering just under the surface of their relationship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "645ac5c8-7de9-3d82-8dca-e8028c74238c",
                                        "entry_id": "220c854d-1be9-3af8-b0e8-a5751190f5c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Heedless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11fddf00-566e-4317-bdb5-0af880fc4d34",
                                                "sense_id": "645ac5c8-7de9-3d82-8dca-e8028c74238c",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: unmindful, absent-minded, thoughtless"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34ed54cf-e0a2-320a-bbf4-40b7fc2cde1c",
                                        "entry_id": "220c854d-1be9-3af8-b0e8-a5751190f5c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Overly repetitive and unchallenging, not requiring any careful attention or providing any significant stimulation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a thing done"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ed74f06-5c89-4348-9b47-23c6cf9added",
                                                "sense_id": "34ed54cf-e0a2-320a-bbf4-40b7fc2cde1c",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: automatic, rote, dull"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33229b07-ac82-33e0-a6aa-f7583e0ca628",
                                        "entry_id": "220c854d-1be9-3af8-b0e8-a5751190f5c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking a mind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "772c62c8-d2af-4308-bb2b-104a9ac25910",
                                                "sense_id": "33229b07-ac82-33e0-a6aa-f7583e0ca628",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: brainless, unconscious, unsentient"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b5fb58b-3d94-443b-b3ad-036653d8496c",
                                                "sense_id": "33229b07-ac82-33e0-a6aa-f7583e0ca628",
                                                "text": "Atheism alleges that mindless scientific forces control the universe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ebf5099d-48e6-4710-bae5-d4096680a845",
                        "source_entry_id": "14195b61-026f-3d53-8cb2-59b54817f102",
                        "source_sense_id": "0520d38b-3a64-3963-804c-49ce572ca836",
                        "target_lang_word": "foolish",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "foolish",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c57a9d9-7ba9-3bae-b5bb-ec800fd04948",
                                        "entry_id": "85cb121c-7b2f-362e-9c61-761af62bff9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking good sense or judgement; unwise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8aa92583-1629-4d3a-8923-8b0ed4b11828",
                                                "sense_id": "9c57a9d9-7ba9-3bae-b5bb-ec800fd04948",
                                                "text": "Next season will, as ever, be a different matter, another problem for Conte to solve as he looks to extend his personal record of four straight league titles in club football across England and Italy. Given his hunger for more – more time, more detail, more work – only the brave or the foolish would bet against him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d38ad60d-fa74-4e21-82fc-ccdbd69884ff",
                                                "sense_id": "9c57a9d9-7ba9-3bae-b5bb-ec800fd04948",
                                                "text": "As a political system democracy seems to me extraordinarily foolish, but I would not go out of my way to protest against it. My servant is, so far as I am concerned, welcome to as many votes as he can get. I would very gladly make mine over to him if I could."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "547c5ada-dcce-37e8-b747-90d7baef0a2b",
                                        "entry_id": "85cb121c-7b2f-362e-9c61-761af62bff9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or characteristic of a fool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e0b008b0-356b-4714-bef5-9aa0db80b5b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "14195b61-026f-3d53-8cb2-59b54817f102",
